# AQ Poster Engine — code + brain + reference data only.
# Rendered output (out/) and scratch working images are LOCAL WORK PRODUCT, not engine source.
# Every PNG here is regenerable from the code + the composition notes in brain/RECREATION_AUDIT.md.

# All generated posters — fresh generations (Workflow A) and recreation iterations (Workflow B)
out/

# Scratchpad: keep the bespoke build SCRIPTS (the actual "how it was built" record),
# drop their rendered/source image outputs and debug dumps.
scratchpad/*.png
scratchpad/*.jpg
scratchpad/*.jpeg
scratchpad/*.pdf
scratchpad/carousel_sunderbans8/
scratchpad/events_photos/
# carousel_2026: keep build_carousel.py / jobs.py / fill_images.py (the build record), drop every
# image. These are real photographs of identifiable children from AQ workshops and this repo is
# PUBLIC — source photos and contact sheets must never be pushed. Same intent as the
# carousel_sunderbans8 exclusion above, expressed per-file so the scripts survive.
scratchpad/carousel_2026/**/src_images/
scratchpad/carousel_2026/**/*.jpg
scratchpad/carousel_2026/**/*.jpeg
scratchpad/carousel_2026/**/*.png
scratchpad/carousel_2026/*.jpg
scratchpad/format_test/
scratchpad/proof/
scratchpad/vision_debug/
scratchpad/yearbook/
scratchpad/yearbook_src/

# Python / OS / editor noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Obsidian vault workspace state (not part of the note content)
AQ Design Engine/.obsidian/workspace*.json
